ENABLED RULER 17 — fixed 36-point filler line.#line_break()
ENABLED RULER 18 — exactly one 36-point slot remains.]

#paragraph(style = "WidowOn", fill = "#dcfce7")[ENABLED LINE 1 — all three green lines must begin together on page 2.#line_break()
ENABLED LINE 2 — a one-line orphan at the bottom of page 1 is forbidden.#line_break()
ENABLED LINE 3 — the declared style enables widow control.]

#paragraph[Page 2 passes when all three green lines begin together.]

#break()

