DISABLED RULER 18 — exactly two 18-point slots remain.]

#paragraph(style = "WidowOff", fill = "#ede9fe")[DISABLED LINE 1 — this purple line must remain at the bottom of page 3.#line_break()
DISABLED LINE 2 — this purple line must also remain at the bottom of page 3.#line_break()
DISABLED LINE 3 — explicit false permits this single line to begin page 4.]

#paragraph[PASS: exactly four pages; green is 0+3 across pages 1–2, while purple is 2+1 across pages 3–4.]
